    "title": "DTDC International Enterprises is Hiring: Warehouse Manager (Mid-Level)",
    "description": "Are you a skilled Warehouse Manager looking for your next big career move? DTDC International Enterprises in Madurai offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout DTDC International Enterprises:\nDTDC International Enterprises is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Handle customs clearance for import and export shipments\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Post Graduate Diploma in relevant field\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in SAP SCM\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in WMS\n• Proficiency in Reverse Logistics\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in Inventory Management\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Learning & development budget\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Madurai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with DTDC International Enterprises!",
